<title>USA: FSA qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--New Hope-Solebury School District, Pa., $22.515 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Harris County Municipal Utility District No 345, Texas, $2.49 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
